WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.471
Authorities in Russia have

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.639
launched a murder investigation

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.508
after a prominent pro-war

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.609
military blogger

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.777
was killed in a blast

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:13.013
at a cafe in St Petersburg.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.782
Loveland to task died in that explosion,

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:16.282
which happened

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.250
during an event

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.186
hosted by a pro-war group on Sunday.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.622
More than 30 others were injured.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.790
State media reports

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.658
that investigators have been questioning

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:26.693
everyone

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:29.029
who was inside the cafe at the time.

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.164
Let's take you now live to London,

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:32.065
where CNN's Clare

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.033
Sebastian is standing

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.567
by monitoring developments for you

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:35.135
Claire.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:36.636
Let's start with that deadly bomb attack

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:37.704
in Saint Petersburg.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:40.774
Has anyone claimed responsibility

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:42.442
No one has claimed responsibility.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:43.877
But I can tell you that

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:44.911
Russian state news agency

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.679
RIA Novosti is now reporting

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.081
that the Interior Ministry

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:49.816
has placed a 26 year

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:50.884
old Saint Petersburg

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.419
resident named Daria Trepova

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:54.654
on their wanted list.

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.556
It says that she is wanted

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:58.591
under an article of the Criminal Code.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.660
It does not say which one.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.928
But we now have that name

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:03.029
and of course her date of birth,

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:05.031
which puts her at 26 years old.

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:06.533
She has been named in state

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.802
media reports as a potential suspect

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:10.236
in this matter.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.572
RIA Novosti has spoken to eyewitnesses

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:15.775
at the scene who say they saw her hand

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.477
or a woman, not necessarily this woman,

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:20.113
but they saw a woman hand a figurine

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:21.781
to Vladlen Tatarsky

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:22.916
who was at an event

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:23.616
where he was

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:26.052
speaking, and that the explosion happened

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:27.220
shortly after that.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.555
So these are the details

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:31.291
that are emerging from that event.

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:32.959
In terms of political reaction,

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.260
not much as of yet.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:34.994
We've heard

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.463
only really from the Foreign Ministry

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:37.297
spokeswoman, Maria

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:38.898
Zakharova, who said

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.600
that Russian journalists,

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.101
she said, are

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.535
constantly experiencing

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.170
threats of reprisals, reprisals

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.340
from the Kiev regime and its inspires,

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:49.309
which are increasingly being implemented.

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:50.877
They're pointing the finger

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:51.978
there at Ukraine.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.346
Interestingly, Yevgeny

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:54.747
Prigozhin, a Viognier,

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:55.982
he has now come out

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.984
and pretty much admitted that this cafe

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.919
was affiliated with Wagner

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.688
and has said that he actually disagrees

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:02.122
with that,

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:02.956
that he thinks

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.191
this was probably a group of radicals

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.127
and not affiliated

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:08.361
with the government of Ukraine.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:09.929
So a lot of speculation

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:10.930
at the moment flying around.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.465
But we can see that given the scale

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.399
of the destruction

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.335
investigation, still ongoing

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:16.803
investigations are ongoing.

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:18.037
Claire, talk to us about the man

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:20.140
who was the target of this assassination,

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.708
Maxine Forman.

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:22.275
Yeah, Maxine,

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.543
formerly known

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:26.179
by his blog, a name of LED Interest,

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.314
which comes from a sort of postmodern

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:31.050
Russian novel by Bolivian

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.519
called Generation P.

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:33.553
Inspired by that,

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:35.622
he was part of a cohort of Russian

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:36.623
military bloggers

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:37.924
who really can see him there

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.058
in one of his videos,

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:39.993
offered a less

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:41.060
censored, more

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.196
raw view of what was happening

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.664
on the Russian side of the front line.

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:45.465
Then suddenly we get

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.000
from the Russian Ministry of Defense.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.635
Another official source

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:51.638
says he was actually born in Ukraine,

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:54.774
fought from 2014 on the side of Russian

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.876
backed separatists in the Donbas

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:57.677
and then switched over

00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:58.144
to becoming

00:02:58.144 --> 00:02:58.878
a blogger, set up

00:02:58.878 --> 00:02:59.679
his channel

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:00.480
in 2019

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.282
and amassed a really big following.

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:04.517
More than half a million people.

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:07.353
He moved in ultranationalist circles.

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:08.988
Interestingly, he has been photographed

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.323
with Daria Dugin,

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.692
who was assassinated in a car bomb

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:13.493
in August,

00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:15.028
the daughter of an ultranationalist

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:16.896
ally of President Putin.

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:17.864
So an interesting character

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:18.932
has in the past

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:19.832
been critical

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:22.035
of how the special military operation

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:22.936
has been conducted.

00:03:24.137 --> 00:03:25.338
Sebastian reporting.

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:27.207
Thank you so much, Claire

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.642
And the head of the Russian mercenary

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:30.643
group, Wagner, says

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.912
a Russian flag has been raised in memory

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:34.447
of the military blogger

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:36.382
on the battlefield in Bermuda.

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.918
All those comments from Yevgeny Prigozhin

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:40.853
coming in, a brief video

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:42.322
he claims was reported

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:44.190
in the eastern Ukrainian city.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.391
CNN can't immediately

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:46.726
confirm the location

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:49.095
where Prigozhin recorded the message,

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:50.363
holding a flag

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:53.433
that was indistinct in the darkness

